Package: inlaws
Title: Additional Distribution Families for mgcv
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Gavin", "Simpson", email = "ucfagls@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Additional response distribution families for generalized additive
    models fitted with 'mgcv'. Includes censored, count, ordinal, compositional,
    and extreme-value families, their distribution callbacks, and mathematical
    validation notes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0),
    mgcv (>= 1.9-3)
Imports:
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    MASS,
    brms
URL: https://github.com/gam-mafia/inlaws
BugReports: https://github.com/gam-mafia/inlaws/issues
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
